      "text": "NO-SINGLE-JUDGE-WASTE-GATE invariant: any waste or verdict metric that gates fleet behavior needs a second judge arm plus a reported agreement score before it gates. Measured instance in the 85-session agent study: the two judges (self-judge vs 35B judge) agree 61% of the time, the self-judge calls 8% of hesitations wasted where the 35B judge calls 37% wasted, and both-agree waste is about 12%.",
