      "text": "# SELF ARCHAEOLOGY S2 + CENSUS CURE - 2026-10-16 Classification: RECEIPT (audit + incident cure) Producer: zcode-seat-20261016 Commission: \"Go\" - the S2 digs, the free-lane asks, and everything the Go covered. ## THE CENSUS INCIDENT, CURED (the headline) The 10-15 and 10-16 census patrol exit-2s were fossil-checks on the 12-day-old carrier, and the fresh collect they forced surfaced a real defect: the venv had drifted from requirements. Repair, by bytes: - Found: 5,136 collected / 4 errors (pandas missing; fastapi missing x3). - Restored per requirements. txt: pandas, fastapi (+httpx), then the pandas chain - python-dateutil (first install was METADATA-ONLY: pip show said post0 while `import dateutil` failed; force-reinstall fixed it), then joblib + scikit-learn for tests/test_gps_router_v0. - Final: **5,158 tests collected / 611 files, ZERO collection errors** (moment 2026-10-16T14:59Z, 12. - Carrier refreshed in AGENTS. md per the B2-249 shape law, drift attributed (+800 collected / +93 files; 91 committed test-file touchings: heartbeat locks fda902344, backup_chain 6e499adfc, merkle-cure a2ae802a6, riddler veil dec771d24, gstd commit-harness ea8456d32, table_turn restore 852bdc48d, plus the width-lane waves). Tomorrow's 08:30 patrol should read green; if it does not, the incident reopens. ## THE CURSOR DIG (the birth seat) 9 GB): 98,766 KV rows - 141 composers, 53,122 message bubbles, 436 checkpoints. The Cursor seat's full chat history is intact. - Agent transcripts: 75 jsonl, ALL dated 2026-08-04/05 - the two days around the publish baseline, including the never-imported ef5fea88 (3. 5 MB, with This is the estate's first-week working memory. ## THE GROK BOT FINDING (August databanks) - Local store is hollow: Local Storage leveldb holds 657 bytes; no IndexedDB; Partitions is 8. 5 MB of webview state. The conversation memory is Conclusion: the August databanks are reachable only by DRIVING the owned Grok desktop app (or the operator reading them), and this seat has no computer-use lane loaded this session. STAGED as S3 - needs a desktop-drive lane (light-operator is a canon doc, not a driver). ## THE FREE LANE (feeding the organ) - Studies A and B LANDED (10:22/10:23 EDT, $0. 00 each, banked in memory/runs/hermes_burn/usage. jsonl): entropy-split instrument spec + coverage-receipt v0 design, at watch/inbox/hermes_burn/. - Queued this sitting: H247_A2A_PATTERN_CARD (the stateless-worker pattern card for the gstdcoin A2A repo, grounded in our runbook laws) and H247_BRIDGE_GUARDIANS_DOSSIER (the LayerZero DVN / Hyperlane ISM guardian design for gstd-bridge v1, grounded in the wormhole RED verdict + the at watch/inbox/gstd_map_20261016/A2A_README_SUMMARY. - Grok databank drive (S3, needs desktop-drive lane or operator paste). - Cursor deep fold (the 75 birth-week transcripts + composer bubbles) - the fold pathway (oral_history seat_pools) is ready when the operator wants the August seat memory in the corpus. - Study C weekly cadence; the register's operator-hands rows (login tabs, netsh 8765, 5 TON, custody drill, GB disclosure PR send, FINAL_POSTS through the veil).",
