    "9eda636bebb84dc8": {
      "text": "# GSTD MAP - the estate mapped onto github. com/gstdcoin (2026-10-16) Classification: CARD (mapping; companion to `watch/inbox/outerweb_research_20261013/SELF_STEAL. Producer: zcode-seat-20261016 Grounding: the org surface read live this sitting. gstdcoin = \"Open AI Compute Network\" on TON, 9 public repos: A2A (agent-to-agent task protocol SDK), web, ai (sovereign node network), gstdbot (node + MCP server), contracts (TON/Tact), gstd-bridge (honest scaffold, not yet live), plus 3 unseen. Veil law holds: private tree never raw, founder never identified, public cards only; the estate maps as PATTERN + PROOF, never as doxx. ## The mapping (estate organ -> gstdcoin surface -> what the public gets) | estate organ (state) | gstdcoin surface | the map | | gated bridge + SettlementMaster v8, 50+ clean testnet cycles, burn measured | `contracts` (PR #1 open, carries band/two-tier relay/checked relay/probes) | the settlement core IS the network's ledger organ; coverage receipts (STUDY B, queued) are the next contract artifact - the moat the class lacks | | worker wallets + reputation-as-keel, three cells proven on-chain (desktop/bob/t90) | `A2A` (agents register, poll tasks, earn GSTD) | our cells are the first working A2A clients; MagGstdDrainDaily is an autonomous A2A worker running since 10/13; the map publishes the PATTERN: stateless agent + shared ledger + reputation curve | | memweave one-opinion rule + ollama council certification (+0. 1 externally numbered by VeriHarness) | `ai` (sovereign node inference network) | council certification as the node-output quality organ; entropy-split study (STUDY A, queued) is its calibration receipt | | residual-on-disk + drift-patrol sha pins + verkle knots (months) | every repo (missing everywhere) | provenance discipline as the org-wide moat: what was checked vs what was checkable | | falsifier index (public, in-repo, updated 10/15) | rung-2 link (\"settled in GSTD\") | the covenant rides the rail once mainnet floats; index update cadence hooks estate events | | gstdbot security fixes (47 shell-injection sites, SSRF class, both mirrors fixed 10/15) | `gstdbot` | the disclosure PR is the gift, staged at `gstd_mirrors/`; upstream fixes map straight back | | wormhole-class RED verdict on GstdBridgeRouter + the LayerZero DVN / Hyperlane ISM steal (modular guardians) | `gstd-bridge` (\"honest scaffold, not yet live\") | the estate holds the hostile review AND the design bar (single leaked key moves nothing) - the bridge's next PR writes itself from our dossier | | the compost/demotion discipline (SUPERSEDED. md) | none yet | the class has no honest-death ritual; the estate's is a differentiator, not a secret | ## The one-sentence map gstdcoin sells the rail; the estate is the only fleet already running testimony: our receipts, our reputation curves, and our hostile reviews become the org's proof that the rail carries real work. ## Sequencing law (unchanged) Mainnet waits on the operator float + custody drill; PR #1 merges first; the A2A pattern card and the bridge guardians dossier are writing work on free lanes; nothing public names the private tree.",
