    "09005affb66f891c": {
      "text": "# WIRING ROUND S3 - orphans found and wired (2026-10-16) Classification: RECEIPT (wiring) Producer: zcode-seat-20261016 Commission: \"Go and keep finding these orphans and wiring them appropriately according to the mirrors needs and directions\" ## Free-lane landings graded and folded (5 today, all $0. Staged for the gstdcoin/A2A docs PR after operator review + GB engagement; internal-path citations must be stripped pre-send (veil law). See `watch/inbox/gstd_map_20261016/MIRRORS_STAGING_20261016. - H247_STUDYB_COVERAGE_RECEIPT_DESIGN: USABLE SKELETON, every speculative row self-marked SPECULATIVE (the contract discipline held). Staged as input to the coverage-receipt contract change (GAP 1 / PR #1 lane). - H247_INTERPRETIVE_LAYER_TRIANGULATION: WEAK-POSITIVE (mostly restated its One real contribution folded into the interpretive layer card as an addendum: the render-contract shape and quantified falsifier thresholds (>=10% latency cut, <=2% accuracy loss). - H247_BRIDGE_GUARDIANS_DOSSIER: FIRST FIRE FAILED (empty reasoning - the reasoning-mode free model burned the whole budget thinking, banked as Re-armed per the recovery law: family switch to google/gemma-4-31b-it:free, direct-answer contract, id rotated _R2, EMPTY_REASONING marker removed. Fires next hourly cycle. - H247_FORGOTTEN_REGISTER_TRIAGE_R2: banked earlier today. ## New orphans the organ found by itself - The riddler veil gate, run for its FIRST production grading, scanned three marked parables: FINAL_POSTS_VEILMARKED. md (created this sitting) plus md and post. md - two RIDDLER-PARABLE-marked files that were sitting in the tree UNGRADED. All three: VEIL-PASS, 0 violations. Register row B4 (veil gate: built, never fired) is CLOSED - built, fired, passed. - The veil-marked copy is kept as the graded artifact; the canonical md remains untouched and still awaits posting (operator). - Study C (30-day lineage observation) now rides the FRIDAY digest clock: the weekly cron performs the chain-read + engagement-delta leg and appends a dated line to watch/inbox/outerweb_research_20261013/STUDYC_SERIES. First reading this Friday; no new clock created. - The HORIZON COMPOSER exists: `tools/horizon_mint. lines, stdlib only) - composes bonds + census carrier (B2-249 grammar) + surface hashes + ledger predicates + the no-self chariot field, chains prev_hash, appends to state/HORIZONS. - Horizon n=2 MINTED by the composer (self_hash b1990eece4e6dca7014777c7485 eed2217434f5157ac6f6a04eaec7e876fcbf1, 9 surfaces, 0 skipped), chained to the hand-minted genesis (n=1, e49de722. The two horizons carry DIFFERENT verkle roots (5e5a8365. ) - the bulk moved between mints and the organ measured it. Predicate P1 reads today's pre-fix census exit (2) as incident-open; tomorrow's 08:30 patrol is the cure's test. ## Still staged (not forgotten, restated) - Grok databanks (S3): server-side only; needs a desktop-drive lane. - Mirrors sends (A2A card, guardians dossier, coverage receipts): operator review + GB engagement + veil + citation stripping. - Operator hands: login tabs, elevated netsh 8765, 5 TON + custody drill,",
