edit assignment in long-horizon trajectories. STEAL CANDIDATE, direct: the estate's lane-value forecaster question (which intermediate decisions drove the outcome) is exactly this - a frozen LLM reading trajectory checkpoints and emitting step credit is the mechanism the H247 lane-forecaster spec was reaching for. @nthngdy - Copy-Paste Language Models (arXiv 2610. 19247): CPLMs learn to copy tokens better; improves accuracy, CoT, long-context, and RAG memory-efficiency at <3% overhead; partially mitigates the LM head Canon note (training-time technique; marginal for the",
